    "_note": "Stage 19 (D098). Milliseconds; easing as cubic-bezier points, never linear. fast and base are interface feedback, hero is the first-impression moments (the welcome rings, a match), sway is the back-and-forth of the landing page's shoreline, loop is one cycle of a gentle ambient movement (it stops within 5 seconds, or has a pause control: WCAG 2.2.2). rise is how far things move up as they appear (points); stagger is the gap between list items. Every animation follows the reduce-motion setting (components.md).",
